  "text_source": "FunASR转录，未全量逐字听核；时间为模型估计",
  "core_text": "二十四岁被日军压赴刑场，他的一抹微笑震撼中国八十年，每一位中国人来到这里，都应该给他表达最崇高的敬意。然位就是曾经被日寇进行了残酷的审讯，轮流的殿污，整整被折磨了六天六夜，然而他却只字未提我党的秘密，在日寇面前毫不畏惧的露出气脸，歼灭笑容。她就是我们最美的抗日女战士，铁骨铮铮的巾帼女英雄。程本华到底是什么样的底气？能让一个二十四岁的女孩在生死关头灭世屠刀笑对死亡？今天，我们就抛开教科书的简短介绍，完整读懂这位被低估的巾国英雄程。本华。如今，安徽和县的城市广场上，他的雕像静静处理，历经八十多年，风雨初刷，依旧身姿挺拔，孝意如初。他守着这座自己用生命守护的小城，看着如今车水马龙、烟火升腾的盛世人间，默默见证着山河无恙，国泰民安。很多人不知道，程本华从来不是天生的英雄，她只是乱世里挺身而出的普通姑娘。一九一四年，他出生在安徽和县一个再平凡不过的百姓家庭，没有显赫家室，没有过人天赋，从小就是一个善良、正直、有主见的女孩。在那个封建思想根深蒂固的年代，大部分女孩子都被禁锢在深宅小院，医生围着针线、灶台、家庭打转，没人关心家国大事，但成本化不一样。他从小就不愿被世俗规矩束缚，读书、识字、关注时局，心里始终装着家国天下。彼时的旧中国，积贫积弱，任人欺凌，列强轮番入侵，战火常年不休，底层老百姓挣扎在温饱，与生死之间，日子过得苦不堪言。看着满目疮痍的山河、流离失所的乡亲，年少的程本华心里悄悄埋下了一颗种子。如果国家需要，我一定挺身而出，守护家乡、守护同胞。借着求学的机会，程本华主动加入了当地的童子军队伍。不同于当下的素质教育，民国时期的童子军核心就是魔力意志、储备国防力量。别人怕苦怕累，逃避训练，他却次次全员参与，认真练习队列格斗、基础防卫技能，日复一日打磨自己的体魄和心性。几年下来，原本柔弱的小姑娘练就了一身坚韧不拔的性子，遇事果敢，临危不乱，骨子里藏着不输男儿的血性与担当。他常常奔走在街头巷尾，向身边的街坊邻里宣讲爱国道德，呼吁年轻人自立自强，守护家国用自己的微薄之力，点亮乱世里的点点星火。一九三七年，卢沟桥事变爆发，全面抗战的烈火席卷整个华夏大地平静的生活，彻底被打破。日军铁蹄一路南下，烧杀抢掠，无恶不作，所到之处，寸草不生，民不聊生。长江沿岸的河线地理位置特殊，很快就沦为抗战前线，战火直接烧到了家门口。昔日热闹安稳的小城，瞬间被硝烟笼罩，枪炮声日夜不绝，百姓人心惶惶，四处逃难。危难时刻，和县当地政府迅速组建抗日人民自卫军，号召全城有志之士站出来保卫家乡，抵御外敌。彼时的成本滑，刚刚和爱人刘志仪成婚不久，正是新婚燕尔，甜蜜安稳的幸福时刻。按照普通人的想法，乱世求存，安稳度日，就是最大的失望。可面对破碎的山河受难的乡亲，程本华没有丝毫犹豫。果断放弃了安稳的小家生活，和丈夫一起报名参军，毅然投身抗日战场。从此，她脱下家常布衣，换上朴素军装，告别儿女情长，扛起保家卫国的责任。在那个人人自危、争相逃命的年代，一个二十出头的小姑娘主动奔赴枪林弹雨的战场，这份勇气和格局远超无数成年人。进入自卫军后，程本华从来没有因为自己是女性，就搞特殊享优待。战场上，他和男战士一样冲锋在前，坚守阵地。面对装备精良、凶悍残暴的日军，从不退缩，绝不畏惧每一次敌军进攻，他都手持武器坚守阵线。凭借过硬的训练功底和顽强的意志，一次次打退敌人的冲锋战场之外，他更是队伍里的暖心之助。他深知，抗战不是靠少数人的热血，而是靠所有人的同心协力。于是，他走遍县城各个村落，挨家挨户动员百姓，讲述日军的残暴行径，普及抗日救国的意义，号召大家有钱出钱，有力出力。在他的真诚感召下，越来越多的普通百姓放下锄头，拿起器械加入抗日队伍，让和县的抗日力量愈发壮大。同时，他还主动承担后勤保障伤员、慰问物资整理的工作，把队伍的后方打理的井井有条，让前线战士没有后顾之忧。命运从来不会因为勇敢就格外温柔。战争的残酷，终究还是降临在了这个年轻姑娘身上。在和县多次惨烈的守城战役中，无数战友接连牺牲血染疆土。程本华最爱的丈夫刘志怡也不幸倒在了守护家乡的战场上。新婚不久天人永隔。这样的打击，足以摧毁一个普通人的意志。无数个深夜，她强忍泪水默默悲痛，可天亮之后，她依旧挺直腰板站上战场。她心里清楚，个人的悲痛，在民族危亡面前不值一提。丈夫用生命守护的家国，必须由自己继续坚守，化悲痛为力量的成本华，变得更加坚毅、更加果敢，独自扛起了守城抗敌的重任，带领剩余战士坚守防线，成为和县抗日队伍中最亮眼的巾帼力量。一九三八年五月，日军集结大批量兵力，配备重型武器，对和县发起了毁灭性的猛攻。当时守城的自卫军大多是普通百姓，组建装备简陋，缺乏专业作战经验，加上没有外援支持，敌我实力差距悬殊，全体战士浴血奋战，拼死抵抗，坚守数日之后，终究寡不敌众，和县城门不幸被攻破。城池沦陷后，大部队紧急组织突围撤离。为了掩护战友和无辜百姓安全转移，程本华主动申请留守断后，他带着为数不多的剩余战士，在结巷之间和日军展开激烈巷战，拼死阻击敌军激战数日，弹尽粮绝，体力透支。在四面合围的绝境中，这位坚守家乡的女战士不幸落入日军魔爪。被俘之后，日军摸清了程本华，是和县抗日核心骨干，妄图从她口中撬出自卫军的隐藏据点，剩余兵力和作战计划，彻底肃清当地抗日力量。为了逼他投降，日军开启了轮番的威逼利诱。先是许诺高官厚禄，荣华富贵，告诉他，只要归顺日军，就能摆脱苦难，安稳度日，被城本华丽声痛斥断然拒绝。软的不行。日军立刻露出残暴本性，对他施以连日酷刑，鞭吃折磨，囚禁身心双重摧残。让他遍体鳞伤，虚弱不堪，可整整数日的折磨，没有让他吐露半个字的情报。没有让他有一丝一毫的妥协，哪怕身陷绝境，受尽苦难，他始终坚守底线，心怀家国用血肉之躯，守住了抗日战士的尊严与气节。无计可施的日军，彻底被这个年轻姑娘的不屈意志震撼，也彻底失去了耐心。想终决定公开处决程本华。想用他的死亡威慑全城百姓，磨灭所有人的抗日斗志。行刑当天，日军强行驱赶大量百姓到场，为官安排战地记者全程拍摄，妄图记录下中国人的恐惧与卑微。可让敌军万万没想到的是，面对冰冷的屠刀和必死的结局。二十四岁的程本华没有丝毫恐惧，他缓缓站直身体，整理好破旧的衣衫，双手抱胸，昂首挺臂，迎着寒光闪闪的军刀，露出了一抹淡然有坚定的微笑。这一笑是对侵略者残暴行径的极致灭视，是对死亡的坦然无惧，更是坚信华夏必胜光明中来的绝对信仰。随着刀锋落下一代，巾帼英雄永远定格在了二十四岁的青春年华。八十多年岁月流转，硝烟散尽，山河换新颜，曾经满目疮痍的和县，如今繁华安宁、烟火不息，曾经饱受欺凌的中国，如今国富民强，屹立东方。我们现在吹的风，看的景想的岁月静好，都是程本华。这样的先烈，用青春和热血换来的。她本是花样年华的普通女孩，本该拥有平淡幸福的一生，却在乱世之中挺身而出，舍小家为大家，以柔弱之屈。但民族大义，他的微笑不是懦弱的妥协，而是中国人刻在骨子里的骨气与忠诚。他的牺牲不是无畏的落幕，而是照亮民族前路的星火微光。如今，很多人追求名利，贪图安逸，却渐渐忘记了盛世是来之不易。正是无数像程本华一样的无名先烈，以身许国，浴血奋战，才换来了我们当下的国泰民安。英雄不该被遗忘，历史不该被尘封。如果你也敬佩这位笑对屠刀的巾帼英雄，记得关注我，点赞、转发、收藏、评论区留下一句致敬先烈忠魂，传承爱国风骨，让英雄故事永远被世人铭记。",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00001",
      "start_ms": 110,
      "end_ms": 2850,
      "text": "二十四岁被日军压赴刑场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00002",
      "start_ms": 3510,
      "end_ms": 7230,
      "text": "他的一抹微笑震撼中国八十年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00003",
      "start_ms": 8029,
      "end_ms": 9910,
      "text": "每一位中国人来到这里，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00004",
      "start_ms": 10350,
      "end_ms": 13390,
      "text": "都应该给他表达最崇高的敬意。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00005",
      "start_ms": 14310,
      "end_ms": 18530,
      "text": "然位就是曾经被日寇进行了残酷的审讯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00006",
      "start_ms": 19150,
      "end_ms": 20150,
      "text": "轮流的殿污，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00007",
      "start_ms": 20470,
      "end_ms": 22910,
      "text": "整整被折磨了六天六夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00008",
      "start_ms": 23510,
      "end_ms": 26310,
      "text": "然而他却只字未提我党的秘密，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00009",
      "start_ms": 26790,
      "end_ms": 30000,
      "text": "在日寇面前毫不畏惧的露出气脸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00010",
      "start_ms": 30080,
      "end_ms": 31060,
      "text": "歼灭笑容。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00011",
      "start_ms": 31620,
      "end_ms": 34800,
      "text": "她就是我们最美的抗日女战士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00012",
      "start_ms": 35460,
      "end_ms": 38045,
      "text": "铁骨铮铮的巾帼女英雄。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00013",
      "start_ms": 40270,
      "end_ms": 42910,
      "text": "程本华到底是什么样的底气？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00014",
      "start_ms": 43190,
      "end_ms": 49770,
      "text": "能让一个二十四岁的女孩在生死关头灭世屠刀笑对死亡？"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00015",
      "start_ms": 51050,
      "end_ms": 51510,
      "text": "今天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00016",
      "start_ms": 51810,
      "end_ms": 54210,
      "text": "我们就抛开教科书的简短介绍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00017",
      "start_ms": 54610,
      "end_ms": 58870,
      "text": "完整读懂这位被低估的巾国英雄程。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00018",
      "start_ms": 58870,
      "end_ms": 59555,
      "text": "本华。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00019",
      "start_ms": 60080,
      "end_ms": 60480,
      "text": "如今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00020",
      "start_ms": 60600,
      "end_ms": 62695,
      "text": "安徽和县的城市广场上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00021",
      "start_ms": 63130,
      "end_ms": 65265,
      "text": "他的雕像静静处理，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00022",
      "start_ms": 65750,
      "end_ms": 67175,
      "text": "历经八十多年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00023",
      "start_ms": 67460,
      "end_ms": 68405,
      "text": "风雨初刷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00024",
      "start_ms": 69060,
      "end_ms": 70715,
      "text": "依旧身姿挺拔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00025",
      "start_ms": 71240,
      "end_ms": 72285,
      "text": "孝意如初。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00026",
      "start_ms": 73040,
      "end_ms": 76385,
      "text": "他守着这座自己用生命守护的小城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00027",
      "start_ms": 76810,
      "end_ms": 81005,
      "text": "看着如今车水马龙、烟火升腾的盛世人间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00028",
      "start_ms": 81630,
      "end_ms": 83695,
      "text": "默默见证着山河无恙，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00029",
      "start_ms": 84040,
      "end_ms": 84795,
      "text": "国泰民安。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00030",
      "start_ms": 85550,
      "end_ms": 86630,
      "text": "很多人不知道，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00031",
      "start_ms": 86870,
      "end_ms": 89855,
      "text": "程本华从来不是天生的英雄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00032",
      "start_ms": 90410,
      "end_ms": 93975,
      "text": "她只是乱世里挺身而出的普通姑娘。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00033",
      "start_ms": 94770,
      "end_ms": 95705,
      "text": "一九一四年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00034",
      "start_ms": 96130,
      "end_ms": 101245,
      "text": "他出生在安徽和县一个再平凡不过的百姓家庭，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00035",
      "start_ms": 102020,
      "end_ms": 103375,
      "text": "没有显赫家室，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00036",
      "start_ms": 103730,
      "end_ms": 105045,
      "text": "没有过人天赋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00037",
      "start_ms": 105500,
      "end_ms": 111710,
      "text": "从小就是一个善良、正直、有主见的女孩。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00038",
      "start_ms": 112680,
      "end_ms": 115705,
      "text": "在那个封建思想根深蒂固的年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00039",
      "start_ms": 116470,
      "end_ms": 121120,
      "text": "大部分女孩子都被禁锢在深宅小院，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00040",
      "start_ms": 121200,
      "end_ms": 124985,
      "text": "医生围着针线、灶台、家庭打转，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00041",
      "start_ms": 125380,
      "end_ms": 127135,
      "text": "没人关心家国大事，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00042",
      "start_ms": 128020,
      "end_ms": 129565,
      "text": "但成本化不一样。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00043",
      "start_ms": 129900,
      "end_ms": 133655,
      "text": "他从小就不愿被世俗规矩束缚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00044",
      "start_ms": 134050,
      "end_ms": 136285,
      "text": "读书、识字、关注时局，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00045",
      "start_ms": 136850,
      "end_ms": 139675,
      "text": "心里始终装着家国天下。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00046",
      "start_ms": 140330,
      "end_ms": 141655,
      "text": "彼时的旧中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00047",
      "start_ms": 142000,
      "end_ms": 142995,
      "text": "积贫积弱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00048",
      "start_ms": 143350,
      "end_ms": 144265,
      "text": "任人欺凌，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00049",
      "start_ms": 144920,
      "end_ms": 146475,
      "text": "列强轮番入侵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00050",
      "start_ms": 146880,
      "end_ms": 148305,
      "text": "战火常年不休，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00051",
      "start_ms": 148920,
      "end_ms": 151480,
      "text": "底层老百姓挣扎在温饱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00052",
      "start_ms": 151540,
      "end_ms": 152625,
      "text": "与生死之间，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00053",
      "start_ms": 153170,
      "end_ms": 154835,
      "text": "日子过得苦不堪言。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00054",
      "start_ms": 155350,
      "end_ms": 159705,
      "text": "看着满目疮痍的山河、流离失所的乡亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00055",
      "start_ms": 160310,
      "end_ms": 164270,
      "text": "年少的程本华心里悄悄埋下了一颗种子。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00056",
      "start_ms": 164430,
      "end_ms": 165535,
      "text": "如果国家需要，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00057",
      "start_ms": 165840,
      "end_ms": 167460,
      "text": "我一定挺身而出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00058",
      "start_ms": 167580,
      "end_ms": 169505,
      "text": "守护家乡、守护同胞。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00059",
      "start_ms": 170020,
      "end_ms": 171325,
      "text": "借着求学的机会，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00060",
      "start_ms": 171630,
      "end_ms": 175335,
      "text": "程本华主动加入了当地的童子军队伍。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00061",
      "start_ms": 175740,
      "end_ms": 177675,
      "text": "不同于当下的素质教育，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00062",
      "start_ms": 178180,
      "end_ms": 183965,
      "text": "民国时期的童子军核心就是魔力意志、储备国防力量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00063",
      "start_ms": 184550,
      "end_ms": 185945,
      "text": "别人怕苦怕累，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00064",
      "start_ms": 186260,
      "end_ms": 187115,
      "text": "逃避训练，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00065",
      "start_ms": 187480,
      "end_ms": 189385,
      "text": "他却次次全员参与，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00066",
      "start_ms": 189780,
      "end_ms": 195920,
      "text": "认真练习队列格斗、基础防卫技能，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00067",
      "start_ms": 196180,
      "end_ms": 199325,
      "text": "日复一日打磨自己的体魄和心性。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00068",
      "start_ms": 200420,
      "end_ms": 201380,
      "text": "几年下来，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00069",
      "start_ms": 201540,
      "end_ms": 206375,
      "text": "原本柔弱的小姑娘练就了一身坚韧不拔的性子，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00070",
      "start_ms": 206910,
      "end_ms": 208005,
      "text": "遇事果敢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00071",
      "start_ms": 208350,
      "end_ms": 209235,
      "text": "临危不乱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00072",
      "start_ms": 210010,
      "end_ms": 213575,
      "text": "骨子里藏着不输男儿的血性与担当。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00073",
      "start_ms": 214430,
      "end_ms": 216595,
      "text": "他常常奔走在街头巷尾，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00074",
      "start_ms": 217130,
      "end_ms": 220525,
      "text": "向身边的街坊邻里宣讲爱国道德，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00075",
      "start_ms": 221160,
      "end_ms": 223815,
      "text": "呼吁年轻人自立自强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00076",
      "start_ms": 224310,
      "end_ms": 227805,
      "text": "守护家国用自己的微薄之力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00077",
      "start_ms": 228420,
      "end_ms": 231015,
      "text": "点亮乱世里的点点星火。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00078",
      "start_ms": 233240,
      "end_ms": 234295,
      "text": "一九三七年，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00079",
      "start_ms": 234900,
      "end_ms": 236585,
      "text": "卢沟桥事变爆发，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00080",
      "start_ms": 236910,
      "end_ms": 241810,
      "text": "全面抗战的烈火席卷整个华夏大地平静的生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00081",
      "start_ms": 242150,
      "end_ms": 243090,
      "text": "彻底被打破。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00082",
      "start_ms": 243310,
      "end_ms": 245075,
      "text": "日军铁蹄一路南下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00083",
      "start_ms": 245460,
      "end_ms": 246445,
      "text": "烧杀抢掠，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00084",
      "start_ms": 246740,
      "end_ms": 247585,
      "text": "无恶不作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00085",
      "start_ms": 248070,
      "end_ms": 248910,
      "text": "所到之处，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00086",
      "start_ms": 249090,
      "end_ms": 250030,
      "text": "寸草不生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00087",
      "start_ms": 250170,
      "end_ms": 251055,
      "text": "民不聊生。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00088",
      "start_ms": 251690,
      "end_ms": 254665,
      "text": "长江沿岸的河线地理位置特殊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00089",
      "start_ms": 255040,
      "end_ms": 256995,
      "text": "很快就沦为抗战前线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00090",
      "start_ms": 257650,
      "end_ms": 259745,
      "text": "战火直接烧到了家门口。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00091",
      "start_ms": 260630,
      "end_ms": 262550,
      "text": "昔日热闹安稳的小城，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00092",
      "start_ms": 262930,
      "end_ms": 265015,
      "text": "瞬间被硝烟笼罩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00093",
      "start_ms": 265840,
      "end_ms": 267505,
      "text": "枪炮声日夜不绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00094",
      "start_ms": 268100,
      "end_ms": 269715,
      "text": "百姓人心惶惶，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00095",
      "start_ms": 270030,
      "end_ms": 270915,
      "text": "四处逃难。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00096",
      "start_ms": 272440,
      "end_ms": 273395,
      "text": "危难时刻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00097",
      "start_ms": 273810,
      "end_ms": 278575,
      "text": "和县当地政府迅速组建抗日人民自卫军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00098",
      "start_ms": 279230,
      "end_ms": 283715,
      "text": "号召全城有志之士站出来保卫家乡，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00099",
      "start_ms": 284040,
      "end_ms": 284855,
      "text": "抵御外敌。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00100",
      "start_ms": 285060,
      "end_ms": 286225,
      "text": "彼时的成本滑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00101",
      "start_ms": 286660,
      "end_ms": 289285,
      "text": "刚刚和爱人刘志仪成婚不久，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00102",
      "start_ms": 289770,
      "end_ms": 291355,
      "text": "正是新婚燕尔，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00103",
      "start_ms": 291790,
      "end_ms": 294005,
      "text": "甜蜜安稳的幸福时刻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00104",
      "start_ms": 294660,
      "end_ms": 296060,
      "text": "按照普通人的想法，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00105",
      "start_ms": 296360,
      "end_ms": 297475,
      "text": "乱世求存，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00106",
      "start_ms": 297890,
      "end_ms": 298845,
      "text": "安稳度日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00107",
      "start_ms": 299150,
      "end_ms": 300385,
      "text": "就是最大的失望。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00108",
      "start_ms": 301060,
      "end_ms": 304545,
      "text": "可面对破碎的山河受难的乡亲，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00109",
      "start_ms": 304850,
      "end_ms": 306805,
      "text": "程本华没有丝毫犹豫。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00110",
      "start_ms": 307690,
      "end_ms": 310390,
      "text": "果断放弃了安稳的小家生活，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00111",
      "start_ms": 310630,
      "end_ms": 312550,
      "text": "和丈夫一起报名参军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00112",
      "start_ms": 313010,
      "end_ms": 315010,
      "text": "毅然投身抗日战场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00113",
      "start_ms": 315590,
      "end_ms": 316070,
      "text": "从此，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00114",
      "start_ms": 316290,
      "end_ms": 318050,
      "text": "她脱下家常布衣，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00115",
      "start_ms": 318430,
      "end_ms": 320030,
      "text": "换上朴素军装，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00116",
      "start_ms": 320170,
      "end_ms": 321710,
      "text": "告别儿女情长，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00117",
      "start_ms": 322190,
      "end_ms": 324450,
      "text": "扛起保家卫国的责任。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00118",
      "start_ms": 324930,
      "end_ms": 328170,
      "text": "在那个人人自危、争相逃命的年代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00119",
      "start_ms": 328870,
      "end_ms": 334030,
      "text": "一个二十出头的小姑娘主动奔赴枪林弹雨的战场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00120",
      "start_ms": 334570,
      "end_ms": 338480,
      "text": "这份勇气和格局远超无数成年人。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00121",
      "start_ms": 339080,
      "end_ms": 340280,
      "text": "进入自卫军后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00122",
      "start_ms": 340480,
      "end_ms": 343460,
      "text": "程本华从来没有因为自己是女性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00123",
      "start_ms": 343480,
      "end_ms": 345360,
      "text": "就搞特殊享优待。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00124",
      "start_ms": 345980,
      "end_ms": 346800,
      "text": "战场上，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00125",
      "start_ms": 347160,
      "end_ms": 349980,
      "text": "他和男战士一样冲锋在前，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00126",
      "start_ms": 350580,
      "end_ms": 351720,
      "text": "坚守阵地。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00127",
      "start_ms": 352260,
      "end_ms": 356200,
      "text": "面对装备精良、凶悍残暴的日军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00128",
      "start_ms": 356560,
      "end_ms": 357460,
      "text": "从不退缩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00129",
      "start_ms": 357640,
      "end_ms": 360400,
      "text": "绝不畏惧每一次敌军进攻，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00130",
      "start_ms": 360480,
      "end_ms": 362960,
      "text": "他都手持武器坚守阵线。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00131",
      "start_ms": 363560,
      "end_ms": 367365,
      "text": "凭借过硬的训练功底和顽强的意志，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00132",
      "start_ms": 367910,
      "end_ms": 371895,
      "text": "一次次打退敌人的冲锋战场之外，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00133",
      "start_ms": 372370,
      "end_ms": 375150,
      "text": "他更是队伍里的暖心之助。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00134",
      "start_ms": 375450,
      "end_ms": 376265,
      "text": "他深知，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00135",
      "start_ms": 376740,
      "end_ms": 379255,
      "text": "抗战不是靠少数人的热血，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00136",
      "start_ms": 379660,
      "end_ms": 382345,
      "text": "而是靠所有人的同心协力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00137",
      "start_ms": 382740,
      "end_ms": 383200,
      "text": "于是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00138",
      "start_ms": 383320,
      "end_ms": 385385,
      "text": "他走遍县城各个村落，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00139",
      "start_ms": 385830,
      "end_ms": 387965,
      "text": "挨家挨户动员百姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00140",
      "start_ms": 388450,
      "end_ms": 390435,
      "text": "讲述日军的残暴行径，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00141",
      "start_ms": 390860,
      "end_ms": 393075,
      "text": "普及抗日救国的意义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00142",
      "start_ms": 393500,
      "end_ms": 395995,
      "text": "号召大家有钱出钱，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00143",
      "start_ms": 396390,
      "end_ms": 397550,
      "text": "有力出力。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00144",
      "start_ms": 397670,
      "end_ms": 399455,
      "text": "在他的真诚感召下，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00145",
      "start_ms": 399850,
      "end_ms": 402555,
      "text": "越来越多的普通百姓放下锄头，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00146",
      "start_ms": 402910,
      "end_ms": 405625,
      "text": "拿起器械加入抗日队伍，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00147",
      "start_ms": 406070,
      "end_ms": 408755,
      "text": "让和县的抗日力量愈发壮大。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00148",
      "start_ms": 409510,
      "end_ms": 409990,
      "text": "同时，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00149",
      "start_ms": 410320,
      "end_ms": 415875,
      "text": "他还主动承担后勤保障伤员、慰问物资整理的工作，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00150",
      "start_ms": 416170,
      "end_ms": 419135,
      "text": "把队伍的后方打理的井井有条，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00151",
      "start_ms": 419750,
      "end_ms": 422345,
      "text": "让前线战士没有后顾之忧。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00152",
      "start_ms": 422980,
      "end_ms": 426535,
      "text": "命运从来不会因为勇敢就格外温柔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00153",
      "start_ms": 427090,
      "end_ms": 428310,
      "text": "战争的残酷，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00154",
      "start_ms": 428930,
      "end_ms": 432330,
      "text": "终究还是降临在了这个年轻姑娘身上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00155",
      "start_ms": 433270,
      "end_ms": 436810,
      "text": "在和县多次惨烈的守城战役中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00156",
      "start_ms": 436910,
      "end_ms": 440230,
      "text": "无数战友接连牺牲血染疆土。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00157",
      "start_ms": 440490,
      "end_ms": 446690,
      "text": "程本华最爱的丈夫刘志怡也不幸倒在了守护家乡的战场上。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00158",
      "start_ms": 447370,
      "end_ms": 449430,
      "text": "新婚不久天人永隔。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00159",
      "start_ms": 449830,
      "end_ms": 450810,
      "text": "这样的打击，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00160",
      "start_ms": 451130,
      "end_ms": 453870,
      "text": "足以摧毁一个普通人的意志。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00161",
      "start_ms": 454410,
      "end_ms": 455610,
      "text": "无数个深夜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00162",
      "start_ms": 455910,
      "end_ms": 458980,
      "text": "她强忍泪水默默悲痛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00163",
      "start_ms": 459480,
      "end_ms": 460540,
      "text": "可天亮之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00164",
      "start_ms": 460860,
      "end_ms": 463900,
      "text": "她依旧挺直腰板站上战场。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00165",
      "start_ms": 464740,
      "end_ms": 465820,
      "text": "她心里清楚，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00166",
      "start_ms": 466180,
      "end_ms": 467140,
      "text": "个人的悲痛，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00167",
      "start_ms": 467140,
      "end_ms": 469580,
      "text": "在民族危亡面前不值一提。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00168",
      "start_ms": 470140,
      "end_ms": 472340,
      "text": "丈夫用生命守护的家国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00169",
      "start_ms": 472680,
      "end_ms": 474900,
      "text": "必须由自己继续坚守，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00170",
      "start_ms": 475060,
      "end_ms": 477120,
      "text": "化悲痛为力量的成本华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00171",
      "start_ms": 477480,
      "end_ms": 480160,
      "text": "变得更加坚毅、更加果敢，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00172",
      "start_ms": 480640,
      "end_ms": 483460,
      "text": "独自扛起了守城抗敌的重任，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00173",
      "start_ms": 484080,
      "end_ms": 486635,
      "text": "带领剩余战士坚守防线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00174",
      "start_ms": 487010,
      "end_ms": 491390,
      "text": "成为和县抗日队伍中最亮眼的巾帼力量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00175",
      "start_ms": 491910,
      "end_ms": 493490,
      "text": "一九三八年五月，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00176",
      "start_ms": 493810,
      "end_ms": 496050,
      "text": "日军集结大批量兵力，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00177",
      "start_ms": 496390,
      "end_ms": 498030,
      "text": "配备重型武器，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00178",
      "start_ms": 498810,
      "end_ms": 501690,
      "text": "对和县发起了毁灭性的猛攻。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00179",
      "start_ms": 502510,
      "end_ms": 506050,
      "text": "当时守城的自卫军大多是普通百姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00180",
      "start_ms": 506090,
      "end_ms": 508150,
      "text": "组建装备简陋，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00181",
      "start_ms": 508450,
      "end_ms": 510530,
      "text": "缺乏专业作战经验，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00182",
      "start_ms": 510830,
      "end_ms": 512630,
      "text": "加上没有外援支持，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00183",
      "start_ms": 512730,
      "end_ms": 514910,
      "text": "敌我实力差距悬殊，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00184",
      "start_ms": 515510,
      "end_ms": 517760,
      "text": "全体战士浴血奋战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00185",
      "start_ms": 518100,
      "end_ms": 519180,
      "text": "拼死抵抗，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00186",
      "start_ms": 519820,
      "end_ms": 521160,
      "text": "坚守数日之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00187",
      "start_ms": 521560,
      "end_ms": 523020,
      "text": "终究寡不敌众，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00188",
      "start_ms": 523300,
      "end_ms": 525580,
      "text": "和县城门不幸被攻破。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00189",
      "start_ms": 526460,
      "end_ms": 527740,
      "text": "城池沦陷后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00190",
      "start_ms": 528060,
      "end_ms": 530500,
      "text": "大部队紧急组织突围撤离。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00191",
      "start_ms": 531060,
      "end_ms": 534680,
      "text": "为了掩护战友和无辜百姓安全转移，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00192",
      "start_ms": 535100,
      "end_ms": 538040,
      "text": "程本华主动申请留守断后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00193",
      "start_ms": 538820,
      "end_ms": 541620,
      "text": "他带着为数不多的剩余战士，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00194",
      "start_ms": 542060,
      "end_ms": 546595,
      "text": "在结巷之间和日军展开激烈巷战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00195",
      "start_ms": 547050,
      "end_ms": 551050,
      "text": "拼死阻击敌军激战数日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00196",
      "start_ms": 551530,
      "end_ms": 552610,
      "text": "弹尽粮绝，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00197",
      "start_ms": 552970,
      "end_ms": 553870,
      "text": "体力透支。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00198",
      "start_ms": 553950,
      "end_ms": 555950,
      "text": "在四面合围的绝境中，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00199",
      "start_ms": 556370,
      "end_ms": 561770,
      "text": "这位坚守家乡的女战士不幸落入日军魔爪。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00200",
      "start_ms": 562690,
      "end_ms": 563570,
      "text": "被俘之后，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00201",
      "start_ms": 563930,
      "end_ms": 565710,
      "text": "日军摸清了程本华，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00202",
      "start_ms": 566130,
      "end_ms": 568590,
      "text": "是和县抗日核心骨干，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00203",
      "start_ms": 569110,
      "end_ms": 572890,
      "text": "妄图从她口中撬出自卫军的隐藏据点，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00204",
      "start_ms": 573370,
      "end_ms": 575230,
      "text": "剩余兵力和作战计划，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00205",
      "start_ms": 575650,
      "end_ms": 578380,
      "text": "彻底肃清当地抗日力量。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00206",
      "start_ms": 578740,
      "end_ms": 580000,
      "text": "为了逼他投降，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00207",
      "start_ms": 580500,
      "end_ms": 583240,
      "text": "日军开启了轮番的威逼利诱。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00208",
      "start_ms": 583760,
      "end_ms": 585980,
      "text": "先是许诺高官厚禄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00209",
      "start_ms": 586300,
      "end_ms": 587300,
      "text": "荣华富贵，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00210",
      "start_ms": 587840,
      "end_ms": 588440,
      "text": "告诉他，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00211",
      "start_ms": 588800,
      "end_ms": 590300,
      "text": "只要归顺日军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00212",
      "start_ms": 590460,
      "end_ms": 591980,
      "text": "就能摆脱苦难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00213",
      "start_ms": 592320,
      "end_ms": 593420,
      "text": "安稳度日，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00214",
      "start_ms": 593740,
      "end_ms": 597315,
      "text": "被城本华丽声痛斥断然拒绝。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00215",
      "start_ms": 597910,
      "end_ms": 598710,
      "text": "软的不行。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00216",
      "start_ms": 599050,
      "end_ms": 601170,
      "text": "日军立刻露出残暴本性，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00217",
      "start_ms": 601670,
      "end_ms": 603510,
      "text": "对他施以连日酷刑，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00218",
      "start_ms": 603930,
      "end_ms": 605610,
      "text": "鞭吃折磨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00219",
      "start_ms": 606030,
      "end_ms": 608890,
      "text": "囚禁身心双重摧残。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00220",
      "start_ms": 608950,
      "end_ms": 610390,
      "text": "让他遍体鳞伤，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00221",
      "start_ms": 610790,
      "end_ms": 611830,
      "text": "虚弱不堪，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00222",
      "start_ms": 612370,
      "end_ms": 614270,
      "text": "可整整数日的折磨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00223",
      "start_ms": 614610,
      "end_ms": 617210,
      "text": "没有让他吐露半个字的情报。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00224",
      "start_ms": 617670,
      "end_ms": 620190,
      "text": "没有让他有一丝一毫的妥协，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00225",
      "start_ms": 620870,
      "end_ms": 622410,
      "text": "哪怕身陷绝境，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00226",
      "start_ms": 622810,
      "end_ms": 623910,
      "text": "受尽苦难，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00227",
      "start_ms": 624370,
      "end_ms": 626190,
      "text": "他始终坚守底线，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00228",
      "start_ms": 626550,
      "end_ms": 629420,
      "text": "心怀家国用血肉之躯，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00229",
      "start_ms": 629760,
      "end_ms": 633020,
      "text": "守住了抗日战士的尊严与气节。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00230",
      "start_ms": 633220,
      "end_ms": 634760,
      "text": "无计可施的日军，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00231",
      "start_ms": 635120,
      "end_ms": 639060,
      "text": "彻底被这个年轻姑娘的不屈意志震撼，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00232",
      "start_ms": 639480,
      "end_ms": 641340,
      "text": "也彻底失去了耐心。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00233",
      "start_ms": 642040,
      "end_ms": 644980,
      "text": "想终决定公开处决程本华。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00234",
      "start_ms": 645560,
      "end_ms": 648700,
      "text": "想用他的死亡威慑全城百姓，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00235",
      "start_ms": 649320,
      "end_ms": 651440,
      "text": "磨灭所有人的抗日斗志。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00236",
      "start_ms": 652440,
      "end_ms": 653360,
      "text": "行刑当天，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00237",
      "start_ms": 653780,
      "end_ms": 656900,
      "text": "日军强行驱赶大量百姓到场，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00238",
      "start_ms": 656940,
      "end_ms": 660385,
      "text": "为官安排战地记者全程拍摄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00239",
      "start_ms": 660840,
      "end_ms": 664155,
      "text": "妄图记录下中国人的恐惧与卑微。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00240",
      "start_ms": 664900,
      "end_ms": 667055,
      "text": "可让敌军万万没想到的是，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00241",
      "start_ms": 667520,
      "end_ms": 670940,
      "text": "面对冰冷的屠刀和必死的结局。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00242",
      "start_ms": 671020,
      "end_ms": 674435,
      "text": "二十四岁的程本华没有丝毫恐惧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00243",
      "start_ms": 675120,
      "end_ms": 677155,
      "text": "他缓缓站直身体，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00244",
      "start_ms": 677620,
      "end_ms": 679525,
      "text": "整理好破旧的衣衫，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00245",
      "start_ms": 680030,
      "end_ms": 681145,
      "text": "双手抱胸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00246",
      "start_ms": 681550,
      "end_ms": 682575,
      "text": "昂首挺臂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00247",
      "start_ms": 683210,
      "end_ms": 685395,
      "text": "迎着寒光闪闪的军刀，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00248",
      "start_ms": 685800,
      "end_ms": 689325,
      "text": "露出了一抹淡然有坚定的微笑。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00249",
      "start_ms": 689940,
      "end_ms": 696195,
      "text": "这一笑是对侵略者残暴行径的极致灭视，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00250",
      "start_ms": 697030,
      "end_ms": 699345,
      "text": "是对死亡的坦然无惧，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00251",
      "start_ms": 700190,
      "end_ms": 705215,
      "text": "更是坚信华夏必胜光明中来的绝对信仰。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00252",
      "start_ms": 706000,
      "end_ms": 708440,
      "text": "随着刀锋落下一代，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00253",
      "start_ms": 708480,
      "end_ms": 712240,
      "text": "巾帼英雄永远定格在了二十四岁的青春年华。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00254",
      "start_ms": 712420,
      "end_ms": 714045,
      "text": "八十多年岁月流转，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00255",
      "start_ms": 714360,
      "end_ms": 715355,
      "text": "硝烟散尽，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00256",
      "start_ms": 715770,
      "end_ms": 717155,
      "text": "山河换新颜，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00257",
      "start_ms": 718010,
      "end_ms": 720790,
      "text": "曾经满目疮痍的和县，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00258",
      "start_ms": 721150,
      "end_ms": 724090,
      "text": "如今繁华安宁、烟火不息，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00259",
      "start_ms": 724890,
      "end_ms": 727010,
      "text": "曾经饱受欺凌的中国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00260",
      "start_ms": 727330,
      "end_ms": 728690,
      "text": "如今国富民强，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00261",
      "start_ms": 729250,
      "end_ms": 730490,
      "text": "屹立东方。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00262",
      "start_ms": 731090,
      "end_ms": 732470,
      "text": "我们现在吹的风，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00263",
      "start_ms": 732830,
      "end_ms": 735450,
      "text": "看的景想的岁月静好，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00264",
      "start_ms": 735750,
      "end_ms": 736950,
      "text": "都是程本华。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00265",
      "start_ms": 736990,
      "end_ms": 737970,
      "text": "这样的先烈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00266",
      "start_ms": 738290,
      "end_ms": 740670,
      "text": "用青春和热血换来的。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00267",
      "start_ms": 741410,
      "end_ms": 744010,
      "text": "她本是花样年华的普通女孩，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00268",
      "start_ms": 744550,
      "end_ms": 747150,
      "text": "本该拥有平淡幸福的一生，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00269",
      "start_ms": 747150,
      "end_ms": 750620,
      "text": "却在乱世之中挺身而出，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00270",
      "start_ms": 751140,
      "end_ms": 752660,
      "text": "舍小家为大家，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00271",
      "start_ms": 752960,
      "end_ms": 754340,
      "text": "以柔弱之屈。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00272",
      "start_ms": 754500,
      "end_ms": 756080,
      "text": "但民族大义，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00273",
      "start_ms": 756880,
      "end_ms": 759660,
      "text": "他的微笑不是懦弱的妥协，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00274",
      "start_ms": 760080,
      "end_ms": 764320,
      "text": "而是中国人刻在骨子里的骨气与忠诚。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00275",
      "start_ms": 764960,
      "end_ms": 767740,
      "text": "他的牺牲不是无畏的落幕，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00276",
      "start_ms": 768060,
      "end_ms": 771260,
      "text": "而是照亮民族前路的星火微光。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00277",
      "start_ms": 772040,
      "end_ms": 772520,
      "text": "如今，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00278",
      "start_ms": 772560,
      "end_ms": 773960,
      "text": "很多人追求名利，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00279",
      "start_ms": 774260,
      "end_ms": 775400,
      "text": "贪图安逸，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00280",
      "start_ms": 775760,
      "end_ms": 779095,
      "text": "却渐渐忘记了盛世是来之不易。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00281",
      "start_ms": 779670,
      "end_ms": 783335,
      "text": "正是无数像程本华一样的无名先烈，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00282",
      "start_ms": 783740,
      "end_ms": 784980,
      "text": "以身许国，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00283",
      "start_ms": 785320,
      "end_ms": 786585,
      "text": "浴血奋战，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00284",
      "start_ms": 787050,
      "end_ms": 789945,
      "text": "才换来了我们当下的国泰民安。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00285",
      "start_ms": 790240,
      "end_ms": 791760,
      "text": "英雄不该被遗忘，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00286",
      "start_ms": 792000,
      "end_ms": 793635,
      "text": "历史不该被尘封。"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00287",
      "start_ms": 794360,
      "end_ms": 797765,
      "text": "如果你也敬佩这位笑对屠刀的巾帼英雄，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00288",
      "start_ms": 798170,
      "end_ms": 799070,
      "text": "记得关注我，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00289",
      "start_ms": 799110,
      "end_ms": 805125,
      "text": "点赞、转发、收藏、评论区留下一句致敬先烈忠魂，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00290",
      "start_ms": 805690,
      "end_ms": 807695,
      "text": "传承爱国风骨，"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "v_ae8e034d880048bf_s00291",
      "start_ms": 808580,
      "end_ms": 811755,
      "text": "让英雄故事永远被世人铭记。"
    }
  ],
